  "editorial_title": "MARKET COMMENTARY:",
  "nutshell": [
    "- Between October 2023 and February 2024, a stagger-",
    "- ing 55 Capesizes changed hands. (page 1)",
    "- Within the first 45 days of 2024, 34 P-Pmax/Kmax/",
    "- Pmax vessels have changed hands, almost 50% more",
    "- that the whole Q1 2023(page 1)",
    "- Interest in acquiring dry bulkers remains strong despite",
    "- high prices in contrast mediocre freight rates (page 1)",
